cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Qfóton: Open-Source Hardware-Aware Compiler and Simulator for Silicon Photonic Quantum Processors"
abstract: "Qfóton is an open-source hardware-aware compiler and cleanroom simulator for linear optical quantum computing (LOQC). It transpiles OpenQASM circuits into physical Mach-Zehnder Interferometer (MZI) meshes via Clements SU(N) decomposition, models 220nm silicon-on-insulator (SOI) cleanroom noise, inverts inter-heater thermal cross-talk (K^-1 calibration), and exports foundry-ready GDSII binary mask files."
